  "answer": "#### Rocket Drawing Completed\n\nAll requested elements have been drawn directly onto the Excalidraw canvas with solid fills and verified via pixel inspection and screenshot:\n\n- **Night sky:** Large dark navy rectangle (`#0d1b2a`) covering the canvas.\n- **Stars:** 7 small yellow stars (`#ffea00`) distributed across the sky around the rocket.\n- **Nose cone:** Solid red pointed triangle (`#e63946`) positioned at the top of the body.\n- **Rocket body:** Solid white rounded rectangle (`#f8f9fa`) forming the main chassis.\n- **Stripes:** Two solid red horizontal accent bands (`#e63946`) across the upper and lower fuselage.\n- **Porthole window:** Solid dark navy/blue outer rim (`#1d3557`) with a solid light blue glass center (`#a8dadc`).\n- **Fins:** Two solid red triangular fins (`#e63946`) attached to the left and right base of the body.\n- **Engine base:** Dark grey rounded base mount (`#2b2d42`).\n- **Nozzles:** Two solid grey thruster nozzles (`#8d99ae`) below the engine base.\n- **Flames:** Multi-layered thruster exhaust with a larger orange outer flame (`#ff7b00`) and a smaller bright yellow inner core flame (`#ffea00`).\n\n#### Limitations & Notes\n- None. Every required shape, color, position, and solid fill was rendered and verified without issue.",
